{"seq":1,"slug":"investment-philosophy","title":"投资哲学","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/ideas-and-methods/investment-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"circle-of-competence","title":"能力圈","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/ideas-and-methods/investment-philosophy/circle-of-competence","wordCount":1579,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"mr-market-and-temperament","title":"市场先生与投资性情","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/ideas-and-methods/investment-philosophy/mr-market-and-temperament","wordCount":1651,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"投资哲学\">投资哲学</h1><p>巴菲特的投资哲学，深植于对认知边界与投资心性的深刻把握。本章剖析其两大支柱。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;能力圈&quot;——只投资于自己真正理解的领域的谦逊智慧。第二篇文档讲述&quot;市场先生与投资性情&quot;,揭示驾驭情绪、保持理性的性情如何决定投资成败。</p>\n"}